# Input

```yaml
%YAML 1.2
---
# biome-ignore-all format: after the document header
...
# biome-ignore-all format: after an empty document
---
first:    [1,2]
# biome-ignore-all format: after content
late:    [3,4]
# biome-ignore lint: not a formatter suppression
lint_only:    [5,6]
# biome-ignore format:
missing_reason:    [7,8]
literal: |
  # biome-ignore-all format: scalar content
quoted: "# biome-ignore format: scalar content"
formatted:    [9,10]
---
# biome-ignore-all format: in a later document
last:
     - [11,12]
     - {a:  1,b:  2}

```


# Formatted

```yaml
%YAML 1.2
---
# biome-ignore-all format: after the document header
...
# biome-ignore-all format: after an empty document
---
first: [1, 2]
# biome-ignore-all format: after content
late: [3, 4]
# biome-ignore lint: not a formatter suppression
lint_only: [5, 6]
# biome-ignore format:
missing_reason: [7, 8]
literal: |
  # biome-ignore-all format: scalar content
quoted: "# biome-ignore format: scalar content"
formatted: [9, 10]
---
# biome-ignore-all format: in a later document
last:
  - [11, 12]
  - { a: 1, b: 2 }

